<title>USA: St Paul hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00 lower in a light test. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    58.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    57.50-58.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>US 3-4     290-300 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady to 1.00 lower, decline on heavy weights. Top 46.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-550 lbs   45.50</p>
<p>	     500-700 lbs   46.00</p>
</text>
